:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">The sequence moves from fibres and fabric to rooms, landscapes and people. Material details establish touch; wider scenes establish a mood. Warm neutrals and deeper colour studies hold those different scales together.</p></div></div></div><p data-node-id="1206:1237" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[#4a4a4d] text-[length:14px] w-[1344px]">AI image study / Existing Workbench composition</p></div></SourceComposition>
