<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:132px" data-source-section="1206:1240"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[132px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">WHERE THE DAY BEGINS</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">A bedroom opens onto the forest. The image studies extend the feeling of the fabric into architecture, light and stillness, exploring the atmosphere around the product as carefully as the product itself.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:165px" data-source-section="1206:1241"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[165px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">A CONSISTENT VISUAL WORLD</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">Campaign scenes, material studies and colour experiments test how the brand can remain recognisable across different settings. The direction rests on a repeatable balance: softness, space, human presence and attention to detail.</p></div></div></section>
